WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.232 --> 00:00:01.277
- [Voiceover] It's tournament time.

00:00:01.277 --> 00:00:03.799
Some college basketball players do unique

00:00:03.799 --> 00:00:06.836
things to get ready for a big game.

00:00:06.836 --> 00:00:09.753
(upbeat rap music)

00:00:12.026 --> 00:00:13.846
- [Troy Caupin] On game day, no matter

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.235
how much time there is, I always lay down

00:00:15.235 --> 00:00:18.178
a little bit to get my mind right.

00:00:18.178 --> 00:00:19.218
- [Mike Gesell] I eat the same thing so,

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:22.745
it's chicken, some corn,
some broccoli, a baked potato

00:00:22.745 --> 00:00:26.437
and I finish it off with some pancakes.

00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:27.530
- [Zack Auguste] My pregame ritual song

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.537
is to listen to "March Madness" by Future.

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:31.668
♫ I'm the one that's living lavish

00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:34.943
- Because it gets me ready to go battle.

00:00:34.943 --> 00:00:35.776
- [Austin Burgett] I have a

00:00:35.776 --> 00:00:37.237
handshakes with some of the managers.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.121
I always have to do 'em before

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:41.722
the game to make sure
everything's balanced.

00:00:41.722 --> 00:00:43.036
- [Vince Edwards] I always tape my wrists

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:45.068
and uh, very superstitious about that.

00:00:45.068 --> 00:00:46.914
Having my son's initials on there,

00:00:46.914 --> 00:00:48.154
you have something to play for,

00:00:48.154 --> 00:00:49.284
you have a meaning to it

00:00:49.284 --> 00:00:52.525
and great feeling to
look down and see that.

00:00:52.525 --> 00:00:53.358
- [Riley Lachance] I always put

00:00:53.358 --> 00:00:55.293
my left sock on before my right.

00:00:55.293 --> 00:00:58.580
It's just something I've always done.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:00:59.789
- [Kevin Johnson] When I enter the court,

00:00:59.789 --> 00:01:04.210
I always warm up on the
right side of the court.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.303
- [Marcus Paige] Yeah, I
don't share my secrets.

00:01:05.303 --> 00:01:06.191
Shhh.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.420
(clicking)

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.337
(upbeat rap music)

